    {
      "source": "If the specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a> is not <code>null</code>, it is wrapped. If not, a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a> is retrieved from the context and wrapped.\nOtherwise, a new default validator is created.",
      "translation": "如果指定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a> 不为 <code>null</code>，则对其进行包装。否则，从上下文中检索一个\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a> 并进行包装。\n否则，创建一个新的默认验证器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a> implementation that delegates calls to another <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a>.\nThis <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a> implements Spring's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/SmartValidator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>SmartValidator</code></a> interface but does\nnot implement the JSR-303 <code>jakarta.validator.Validator</code> interface.",
      "translation": "一个委托调用另一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a>实现。此<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/Validator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Validator</code></a>实现了 Spring 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/validation/SmartValidator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>SmartValidator</code></a>接口，但未实现 JSR-303 <code>jakarta.validator.Validator</code>接口。",
      "count": 2
    },
